 "solution": "设一周期为\\(x,y,z\\)，则\\(x^2-yz=y^2-zx=z^2-xy=c\\)。相减得到\\((x-y)(x+y+z)=(y-z)(x+y+z)=0\\)。\n若\\(x+y+z\\ne0\\)，则\\(x=y=z,c=0\\)；若\\(x+y+z=0\\)，则\\(c=x^2+xy+y^2=(y+x/2)^2+3x^2/4\\)。\n选项B中\\(x=2\\)却\\(c=2<3\\)，不可能。A可取\\((1,0,-1)\\)；C可取\\((-1,(1+\\sqrt{13})/2,(1-\\sqrt{13})/2)\\)；D可取\\((2,2,2)\\)。",
